  "description": "EasyRabbitFlow: high-performance RabbitMQ client for .NET. Fluent configuration, optional topology (queue/exchange/dead-letter) generation, reflection-free consumers, configurable retry (exponential/backoff), custom dead-letter routing, temporary batch processing, queue state helpers. Targets .NET Standard 2.1 and .NET 8.",
